---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Gallery from "../../components/Gallery.astro";
---

<Base
  title="CPH Mothership — Sebastián Ortiz de Zevallos"
  description="A critique and invitation to rethink future city-expansions such as Copenhagen's Lynetteholm."
  currentPage="projects"
  theme="blue"
  layout="split"
>
  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__year">2023 · Architecture</div>
    <h1 class="project__title">CPH Mothership</h1>
    <p class="project__subtitle">X-Urban Studio, IAAC · with MuHuai Liu, Akaterini Marinaki &amp; Yang Xiao</p>

    <div class="project__body">
      <p>
        This project is a critique and an invitation to rethink how a future
        city-expansion such as Copenhagen's island "Lynetteholm" can be thought.
        Rem Koolhaas coined the term BIGNESS in 1995 to describe a scale in
        which the project exceeds architecture itself as the conception of a
        single building.
      </p>

      <p>
        From this idea, we intend to radicalize the separation between the
        envelope and the organs of the project, proposing a multi-scalar system
        that acts as a system of systems, a "Mothership" of sorts, blurring the
        edges of the individual and the collective.
      </p>

      <p>
        Its modules come from three experimental precedent projects that
        challenge the vertical typology of the skyscraper. Thus, this counter
        proposal to Lynetteholm does not pretend to offer a better alternative
        nor to describe a dystopian future scenario. It dwells in-between these
        two poles, focusing on creating a new fertile ground for the design of
        future cities through the radicalization of typology.
      </p>

      <h2>Method</h2>
      <p>
        For the module connections we used the Monoceros plugin for Grasshopper
        by Sub.Digital. This way we could define the connections between
        buildings that we wanted and try different combinations.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="collab">
      <p class="collab__label">Collaborators</p>
      <p class="collab__names">Mu-Huai Liu, Aikaterini Marinaki, Yang Xiao</p>
    </div>

    <div class="meta">
      <div><a href="/">← Index</a></div>
      <div>2023</div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Gallery
    slot="gallery"
    slug="cph-mothership"
    images={["01.png", "02.png", "03.png", "04.png"]}
    alt="CPH Mothership"
  />
</Base>
